  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2032.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este domingo se ha celebrado en Artesa la procesi&oacute;n de las Fiestas Promesas, con toda su emotividad y el Santo Sacramento bajo palio, pero con poca asistencia de personas. Este pr&oacute;ximo s&aacute;bado, la Comisi&oacute;n de Fiestas ha programado una cena de sobaquillo en las Escuelas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa13/img_2023.jpg\" alt=\"img_2023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa13/img_2024.jpg\" alt=\"img_2024\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa13/img_2025.jpg\" alt=\"img_2025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa13/img_2026.jpg\" alt=\"img_2026\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa13/img_2027.jpg\" alt=\"img_2027\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa13/img_2028.jpg\" alt=\"img_2028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa13/img_2029.jpg\" alt=\"img_2029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa13/img_2030.jpg\" alt=\"img_2030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa13/img_2031.jpg\"